# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Local secrets and runtime state — never commit
.env
AGENTS.private.md
state/
*.log

# Dispatcher-owned files in a run checkout of this repository. The policy reconciler
# excludes them too; ignoring them here keeps a previously tracked copy from returning.
/.dispatcher/
/.dispatcher-*

# Build output (the service runs TypeScript directly on Node 24)
dist/
macos/DispatcherStatusBar/build/

# Local planning and operator scratch files — not part of the public release
PLAN-issue-*.md
docs/plans/
docs/issue-template.md
docs/plan-template.md
docs/shellcheck-ci.md
ccquota/
